                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Text of Statement to be made by the Chairman, which
                        Mr. Stettinius proposed at private meeting in Mr. Lie’s office during
                        Security Council Meeting on the evening of February</hi> 5<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">th</hi>
                </head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“I feel we should take note of the declaration made before the Security
                        Council by the Representatives of the Soviet Union, the United Kingdom and
                        Greece and also of the views expressed by the <pb facs="0124" n="112"
                            xml:id="pg112"/> Representatives of the following members of the
                        Security Council—the United States, France, China, Australia, Poland, Egypt
                        and The Netherlands—in regard to the question of the presence of British
                        troops in Greece, as recorded in the proceedings of the Council, and
                        consider the matter closed.”</p>
                </quote>
            </div>
